   "y": "The 5-session change of that smoothed relative-strength series, in percentage points: above 0 the sector's 20-day relative strength is still improving, below 0 it is fading.",
   "quadrants": "Leading = x >= 0, y >= 0; Weakening = x >= 0, y < 0; Lagging = both < 0; Improving = x < 0, y >= 0. Dots are coloured by quadrant.",
